WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
Three sisters stand before a throne.

2
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.820
Their father asks how much each loves him.

3
00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:11.180
Then the eldest complains: "Here do you
keep a hundred knights and squires;" Put

4
00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:12.580
it on the scales.

5
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:16.360
One side: a rowdy
household, a struck servant,

6
00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.940
a father who "always
loved our sister most".

7
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.610
The other side: doors shut
on an old man in a storm,

8
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.160
and worse to come.

9
00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.480
So which way do the scales tip?

10
00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:30.140
In this mission, you'll
replay the love test,

11
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.760
and the youngest daughter's
answer: "Nothing, my lord."

12
00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:38.100
You'll weigh the eldest's case,
then track how far the sisters go.

13
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.940
Your mission: decide whether
Goneril and Regan are monsters,

14
00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.560
or daughters with a point.
